{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build and manage your ice cream business.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Organize and upgrade your kitchen and inventories. Find new recipes and flavors, buy new ice-cream carts. Discover each location\u2019s favorite flavors and make customers happy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make And Sell Ice Creams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn new recipes and unlock special ones throughout your journey. Each flavor has a distinct category, each location has it\u2019s own flavor personality. Get to know the locals, understand their tastes, and create treats that bring smiles.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472060/extras/demo_1.gif?t=1748022578\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features in the demo :\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 sales locations in a stylized, colorful world with 6 quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 recipes to satisfy diverse tastes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different customer profiles to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 levels kitchen upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 unique types of ice cream carts, adding charm and variety to your business setup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted music.<br> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3472060?t=1748022578","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3472060?t=1748022578","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472060/edbc7edd0042e7f4285bda61290a8188251d417a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748022578","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472060/edbc7edd0042e7f4285bda61290a8188251d417a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748022578","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descri